an><br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Most grocery stores belong to grocery chains =
=E2=80=94 e.g., Whole Foods, Trader Joe=E2=80=99s, Aldi, Kroger, etc. But w=
hat if you can=E2=80=99t get them to open a store in your city? <br><br></p=
>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">If you=E2=80=99re Atlanta, you do it yourself=
. The city put up $8m in funding, including grants and loans, to bring Azal=
ea Fresh Market to its downtown =E2=80=94 an area that hasn=E2=80=99t had a=
 supermarket&nbsp;in 20 years =E2=80=94 in September, <a href=3D"https://me=
dia.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/MX1sj244yR5W1Z-p-d2-rnnDVLsY3L5HmGv=
