7p879hW5KJC-p3fZsZqW71BlH458NY6_W4WCY5W28kqZ3N6_X09X8G4ZhW8Mys245QbBNLW16Vr=
vx2pjQT0W747VZr6PFKgZW3YcyqR2299yyW2wk40t8LxjLNW7Dz2gw6sRdFQW6cVb1j27MTbwW6=
t4XHS7JxTmXN5vgKxnm42C2W99SS9T1TYbwgW96VF_x1RqXhWW213kQk5dCRNTW3FQF8M5ss41T=
W9lhhct69bD43f2pypK004" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-=
hs-link-id-v2=3D"bNB+L2FY" target=3D"_blank">per</a> <span style=3D"font-st=
yle: italic;">The Wall Street Journal</span>. <br><br><span style=3D"font-w=
eight: bold; font-size: 18px;">How it works</span><br><br>Savi Provisions, =
which runs a chain of organic markets, operates the store, purchasing stapl=
es wholesale so that it can sell them for less or at parity with major chai=
ns. Meanwhile, an upstairs sushi and sandwich counter with beer and wine so=
ld at market prices helps offset the difference. <br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">The city hopes the store will be profitable w=
ithin three years, and plans to open another six miles away.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold; font-size: =
18px;">Why? </span><br><br>Some neighborhoods are considered =E2=80=9C<a hr=
ef=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/MX1sj244yR5W1Z-p-d2=
