2733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"M/QKkj+0" target=3D"_blan=
k">food deserts</a>=E2=80=9D because access to fresh, affordable food is li=
mited. <br><br>Areas that have an abundance of liquor stores and fast-food =
restaurants, where you can buy food but it isn=E2=80=99t healthy, are known=
 as =E2=80=9C<a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/M=
