data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"xIu0kwum" target=3D"_blank">food swamps</a>.=E2=80=9D=
 For obvious reasons, this becomes a health issue.<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold; font-size: =
18px;">Atlanta isn=E2=80=99t alone</span> <br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">During his campaign, NYC mayor-elect Zohran M=
